# Movie Assets Directory

Place movie posters and stills here with the following structure:

## Posters
- movie1-poster-placeholder.jpg
- movie2-poster-placeholder.jpg

Recommended specifications:
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Size: At least 1000x1500px
- Aspect ratio: 2:3 (portrait)
- File size: Under 1MB

## Stills/Gallery Images
- movie1-still1-placeholder.jpg
- movie1-still2-placeholder.jpg

Recommended specifications:
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Size: At least 1920x1080px
- Aspect ratio: 16:9 (landscape)
- File size: Under 800KB
